WEBVTT - Mohan AI-Powered Goal & Task Manager Walkthrough

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Meet Mohan — an intelligent, personal goal and task manager where your long-term vision directly drives daily execution.

00:12.000 --> 00:26.000
Start by defining a meaningful goal. We create "Build my portfolio in four weeks" with a concrete deadline and clear completion criteria.

00:26.000 --> 00:41.000
With one click, AI deconstructs the goal into structured milestones and manageable, 15-to-30 minute daily action items.

00:41.000 --> 00:55.000
Every generated task clearly displays which goal it supports, along with an unambiguous "Definition of Done" so you always know what success looks like.

00:55.000 --> 01:09.000
Need to add something on the fly? Natural language parsing instantly understands: "Prepare my presentation tomorrow at 4 PM for 45 minutes".

01:09.000 --> 01:23.000
Easily inspect, edit, or reschedule tasks with quick actions, rich subtask checklists, and accessible keyboard alternatives.

01:23.000 --> 01:37.000
Mark tasks complete and watch your goal progress update automatically using an exact, transparent mathematical formula — no arbitrary percentages.

01:37.000 --> 01:51.000
When priorities shift or meetings run late, AI replanning redistributes remaining work, respects your working hours, and eliminates burnout.

01:51.000 --> 02:04.000
Experience clarity, calm, and steady momentum every single day. Start your journey with Mohan today.
